^3Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]

^6Items:
- Cloaking Device (2)

^8Attributes:
- Fury (3)
^2-- Regen: 2/.5s > 50
^2-- Decay: .1x
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Sense Immunity
- Tracking Beacon
- Acid Blood

Shadowy assassins who strike most unexpectedly. Damage dealt and kills secured build resource."